    "general": [
      "Follow Swedish public access principles: do not disturb, do not destroy; avoid gardens and cultivated land; close gates in grazing land; do not litter.",
      "Only light fires in prepared fireplaces; extinguish carefully; avoid fires when wildfire risk is high.",
      "Dogs are welcome along the trail but should be kept leashed.",
      "Fishing in lakes and watercourses requires a fishing permit; sea fishing does not."
    ],
    "skuleskogenNationalPark": [
      "During 1 May-30 September, fires are allowed only at designated fire sites and only with supplied or carried-in wood.",
      "During 1 May-30 September, tenting is allowed only at designated tent sites and for at most three nights at the same site.",
      "Visitors may travel only on foot, with a cycling exception on the coastal trail between Entré Syd and Entré Nord.",
      "Fishing is allowed in the sea, not in rivers and lakes.",
      "Dogs must be kept on leash.",
      "Slåttdalsskrevan is no longer recommended to pass through because of rockfall risk according to current section pages."
